* C3 RLC reference A2: parallel tank driven at f0 by a current source
* analytic steady state at resonance: |v| = I*R, phase 0
I1 0 1 SIN(0 1e-05 30992622.0 0 0 0)
C1 1 0 1e-10
L1 1 0 2.6370819393581765e-07
R1 1 0 51352.526124409655
.options method=trap maxord=2 reltol=1e-4 trtol=7 temp=27 tnom=27
.control
set filetype=binary
set num_threads=1
save v(1)
tran 0.25n 200u 0 0.25n
write dr_Q1000_trap_0p25n.raw
quit
.endc
.end
